{
	"name": "Defensive Rifle Stance",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-blunderbuss-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have learned to use a two handed firearm as a defensive weapon as much as an offensive one. While you maintain this stance and have a two handed firearm ready, you can use your reaction when a creature makes a melee attack against you to impose disadvantage on that attack. When you use this reaction, you are no longer at disadvantage when using your two handed firearm while within that creature’s threatened area until the end of your next turn.</p>",
